## Meta-review

- **A scanner that cannot complete under pressure was the remaining
  hole. It completes and executes.** The throw is not the story.
- **AArch64 full pool is not a spill measurement.** Preserved absorbs;
  scratch-only is the both-ISA measurement.
- **Keep the production assertion when the override goes green.**
  Otherwise the guard's remaining job becomes unmeasured.
- **Do not remove `back-edge?` against one spill fixture.** Wider amu
  execution that includes this fixture is a different measurement.

